{"result": {"status": {"code": 0, "msg": "OK"}, "timestamp": "Sat Oct 03 17:52:14 +0800 2026", "data": {"zhibo": [], "focus": [], "top": {"list": [], "html": "", "top_ids": "", "survey_id": []}, "feed": {"list": [{"id": 5124898, "zhibo_id": 152, "type": 0, "rich_text": null, "multimedia": "", "commentid": "live:finance-152-5124898:0", "compere_id": 0, "creator": "yujian@staff.sina.com.cn", "mender": "yujian@staff.sina.com.cn", "create_time": "2026-10-03 17:51:23", "update_time": "2026-10-03 17:51:23", "is_need_check": "0", "check_time": "1970-01-01 08:00:01", "check_status": "1", "check_user": "", "is_delete": 0, "top_value": 0, "is_focus": 0, "source_content_id": "0", "anchor_image_url": "", "anchor": "", "ext": "{\"stocks\":[],\"needPushWB\":false,\"needCMSLink\":true,\"needCalender\":false,\"terms\":[],\"docurl\":\"https:\\/\\/finance.sina.com.cn\\/7x24\\/2026-10-03\\/doc-initxwvx3885573.shtml\",\"docid\":\"nitxwvx3885573\"}", "old_live_cid": "0", "tab": "", "is_repeat": "0", "tag": [{"id": "102", "name": "国际"}], "like_nums": 0, "comment_list": {"list": [], "total": 0, "thread_show": 0, "qreply": 0, "qreply_show": 0, "show": 0}, "docurl": "https://finance.sina.cn/7x24/2026-10-03/detail-initxwvx3885573.d.html", "rich_text_nick_to_url": [], "rich_text_nick_to_routeUri": [], "compere_info": ""}, {"id": 5124897, "zhibo_id": 152, "type": 0, "rich_text": "【同比增24.51% 南方电网统一充电服务平台单日充电量首破千万千瓦时】据中国南方电网有限责任公司，假期首日，南方电网统一充电服务平台“顺易充”单日充电量首次突破千万千瓦时，达到1044.31万千瓦时，同比增长24.51%。", "multimedia": "", "commentid": "live:finance-152-5124897:0", "compere_id": 0, "creator": "yujian@staff.sina.com.cn", "mender": "yujian@staff.sina.com.cn", "create_time": "2026-10-03 17:43:48", "update_time": "2026-10-03 17:43:48", "is_need_check": "0", "check_time": "1970-01-01 08:00:01", "check_status": "1", "check_user": "", "is_delete": 0, "top_value": 0, "is_focus": 0, "source_content_id": "0", "anchor_image_url": "", "anchor": "", "ext": "{\"stocks\":[],\"needPushWB\":false,\"needCMSLink\":true,\"needCalender\":false,\"terms\":[],\"docurl\":\"https:\\/\\/finance.sina.com.cn\\/7x24\\/2026-10-03\\/doc-initxwvz0653060.shtml\",\"docid\":\"nitxwvz0653060\"}", "old_live_cid": "0", "tab": "", "is_repeat": "0", "tag": [{"id": "3", "name": "公司"}], "like_nums": 0, "comment_list": {"list": [], "total": 0, "thread_show": 0, "qreply": 0, "qreply_show": 0, "show": 0}, "docurl": "https://finance.sina.cn/7x24/2026-10-03/detail-initxwvz0653060.d.html", "rich_text_nick_to_url": [], "rich_text_nick_to_routeUri": [], "compere_info": ""}, {"id": 5124896, "zhibo_id": 152, "type": 0, "rich_text": "【马来西亚将于11月起取消部分黄金产品10%的关税】根据马来西亚财政部10月2日发布的文件，马来西亚将从11月1日起取消部分黄金产品10%的进口关税。", "multimedia": "", "commentid": "live:finance-152-5124896:0", "compere_id": 0, "creator": "yujian@staff.sina.com.cn", "mender": "yujian@staff.sina.com.cn", "create_time": "2026-10-03 17:43:35", "update_time": "2026-10-03 17:43:35", "is_need_check": "0", "check_time": "1970-01-01 08:00:01", "check_status": "1", "check_user": "", "is_delete": 0, "top_value": 0, "is_focus": 0, "source_content_id": "0", "anchor_image_url": "", "anchor": "", "ext": "{\"stocks\":[{\"market\":\"global\",\"symbol\":\"hf_xau\",\"key\":\"\\u9ec4\\u91d1\",\"hot\":1201},{\"market\":\"commodity\",\"symbol\":\"nf_au0\",\"key\":\"\\u9ec4\\u91d1\",\"hot\":421},{\"market\":\"fund\",\"symbol\":\"002611\",\"key\":\"\\u9ec4\\u91d1\",\"sym_party_status\":\"0\",\"hot\":46}],\"needPushWB\":false,\"needCMSLink\":true,\"needCalender\":false,\"terms\":[],\"docurl\":\"https:\\/\\/finance.sina.com.cn\\/7x24\\/2026-10-03\\/doc-initxwvx3880430.shtml\",\"docid\":\"nitxwvx3880430\"}", "old_live_cid": "0", "tab": "", "is_repeat": "0", "tag": [{"id": "5", "name": "市场"}, {"id": "102", "name": "国际"}], "like_nums": 0, "comment_list": {"list": [], "total": 0, "thread_show": 0, "qreply": 0, "qreply_show": 0, "show": 0}, "docurl": "https://finance.sina.cn/7x24/2026-10-03/detail-initxwvx3880430.d.html", "rich_text_nick_to_url": [], "rich_text_nick_to_routeUri": [], "compere_info": ""}, {"id": 5124895, "zhibo_id": 152, "type": 0, "rich_text": "俄罗斯任命的官员称，卢甘斯克地区遭袭，造成两人死亡、三人受伤。", "multimedia": "", "commentid": "live:finance-152-5124895:0", "compere_id": 0, "creator": "yujian@staff.sina.com.cn", "mender": "yujian@staff.sina.com.cn", "create_time": "2026-10-03 17:38:16", "update_time": "2026-10-03 17:38:16", "is_need_check": "0", "check_time": "1970-01-01 08:00:01", "check_status": "1", "check_user": "", "is_delete": 0, "top_value": 0, "is_focus": 0, "source_content_id": "0", "anchor_image_url": "", "anchor": "", "ext": "{\"stocks\":[],\"needPushWB\":false,\"needCMSLink\":true,\"needCalender\":false,\"terms\":[],\"docurl\":\"https:\\/\\/finance.sina.com.cn\\/7x24\\/2026-10-03\\/doc-initxwvz0649698.shtml\",\"docid\":\"nitxwvz0649698\"}", "old_live_cid": "0", "tab": "", "is_repeat": "0", "tag": [{"id": "102", "name": "国际"}], "like_nums": 0, "comment_list": {"list": [], "total": 0, "thread_show": 0, "qreply": 0, "qreply_show": 0, "show": 0}, "docurl": "https://finance.sina.cn/7x24/2026-10-03/detail-initxwvz0649698.d.html", "rich_text_nick_to_url": [], "rich_text_nick_to_routeUri": [], "compere_info": ""}, {"id": 5124894, "zhibo_id": 152, "type": 0, "rich_text": "【以军空袭致5人死亡 袭击目标据称为哈马斯高官】以色列方面3日援引消息人士的话称，以军2日对加沙城西部发动的一次空袭，目的是试图打死阿里·阿穆迪。阿里·阿穆迪被视为已故哈马斯领导人叶海亚·辛瓦尔的继任者，但以军目前无法确认这次空袭是否达到目的。消息称，阿穆迪是目前仍留在加沙地带的哈马斯高级官员之一，曾负责哈马斯的媒体通讯工作，并且是辛瓦尔的亲信。据巴勒斯坦方面消息，这次空袭导致5人死亡，其中包括妇女和儿童。", "multimedia": "", "commentid": "live:finance-152-5124894:0", "compere_id": 0, "creator": "yujian@staff.sina.com.cn", "mender": "yujian@staff.sina.com.cn", "create_time": "2026-10-03 17:37:17", "update_time": "2026-10-03 17:37:17", "is_need_check": "0", "check_time": "1970-01-01 08:00:01", "check_status": "1", "check_user": "", "is_delete": 0, "top_value": 0, "is_focus": 0, "source_content_id": "0", "anchor_image_url": "", "anchor": "", "ext": "{\"stocks\":[{\"market\":\"worldIndex\",\"symbol\":\"znb_ta-35\",\"key\":\"\\u4ee5\\u8272\\u5217\"},{\"market\":\"hk\",\"symbol\":\"09988\